# Lemmings M2: cross the Skid Row cracktro with the left button, then shoot the Psygnosis owl.
# The cracktro waits for the button forever; boot.dbg presses it 12 s after a cold boot.
wait 600
click
# "Expansion RAM detected & utilised": 8 colours (reference/expansion-ram.png).
until colours 8
# The owl: 32 colours (reference/psygnosis.png); boot.dbg shoots 1 s after they appear.
until colours 32
wait 50
shot psygnosis
